"""037.md batch X: deepen vv 45, 77, 134, 161.

All four bodies were verified correct against their own verses before rewriting,
so this is depth work only. Each is written on a different portion of the shared
apparatus so it does not duplicate a neighbour:

  v45  takes the cup, the gushing spring, the wine-of-heaven reading (T) and the
       servants implied by "brought round". v44 covers the couches, v46 the
       whiteness and taste, v47 the absence of headiness.
  v77  takes the progeny themselves and what the making-to-endure asserts. v76
       covers the deliverance and v78 (batch W) the remembrance, the sign for
       the worlds, and the wider list of Noah accounts, so none is repeated.
  v134 takes the two readings of "him and his family" -- Lot's immediate family
       or all who followed him. v133 already carries the nephew/cousin point
       (the existing v134 body repeated it; that duplication is removed here)
       and v135 covers the old woman.
  v161 takes the pairing of worshippers and objects of worship as a single
       party, and the framing of the statement. v162 covers the tempting and
       v163 the exception, so neither is repeated.

Guards: no verbatim re-quote of the verse in the opening prose; no verbatim
repeat of blockquote wording in the prose above it; echo the verse's own
distinctive vocabulary; paragraphs distinct so duprate stays under 0.025.
"""

